  "caveats": [
    "4-vCPU/8-GiB tool sizing and concurrency not confirmed; worked example is conditional CU arithmetic.",
    "Other AgentArts activity consumes same monthly CU tiers; engine approximates base band only.",
    "CU billed to 0.0001 precision monthly; wall-clock metering increment not specified.",
    "Unknowns remain null, not free; generic infrastructure modes are opt-in alt.",
    "Worked example assumes resources are released between active windows unless a retained-instance scenario is explicitly discussed.",
    "VAT basis: Unknown: reviewed pricing source does not explicitly establish VAT/tax inclusion.",
    "Residency: China AgentArts public-beta documentation; Beijing-four legacy service differs from newer platform. Region and 4/8 configurable tool support need confirmation.",
    "Re-checked 2026-09-28 (AgentArts 计费说明 v04, 2026-09-28): the only sandbox billing items are CPU (1 CU per vCPU-h) and memory (0.1 CU per GiB-h) for runtime, code interpreter and browser tool; disk/storage is not a billing item, so disk_gib_month=0 (sandbox disk size itself is unpublished). No snapshot or public-network egress item is listed; both stay null (unknown).",
    "Mainland-China console (support.huaweicloud.com, CNY); every feature is labelled 公测 (public beta) on the release-notes page. No SSH is documented (session API only) and the browser tool offers LiveView of the browser via noVNC, not a full desktop: ssh=false, desktop=false.",
    "CU annual pack (beta): example 20,000 CU for CNY 21,105/year (CNY 1.05525/CU, ~5% below on-demand), valid 1 year, needs an existing plan; ~$3,145 prepaid. Not modelled as a mode because the prepaid pack floor cannot be encoded."
  ],
